The Universal Wrestling Federation was formed by Herb Abrams in 1990. Abrams trademarked the UWF name as Bill Watts failed to do so when he promoted under the same name in the 1980s. The two promotions could not be more different, however. Not known for the highest production values, Herb Abrams did manage to get the UWF on Sportschannel America beginning in 1990.
